{"name":"main","commit":{"sha":"6e77a448f9776e837bfc9ab18b833bd5fdc26d3a","node_id":"C_kwDOULC1YdoAKDZlNzdhNDQ4Zjk3NzZlODM3YmZjOWFiMThiODMzYmQ1ZmRjMjZkM2E","commit":{"author":{"name":"Alexey Zhokhov","email":"alexey@zhokhov.com","date":"2026-09-08T13:42:44Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-09-08T13:42:44Z"},"message":"chore: dissolve shared/references into owning skills (#1)\n\nDelete the wholesale-copied shared/references staging set (6 byte-identical\nfiles propagated into every repo at monorepo split, 73% never cited) and keep\nthe byte-identical skill-local copies as the canonical home:\n\n- runtime-trust.md: existing vendored copies in every skill become canonical\n- contribution-handoff.md: the five tailrocks-contribute-* skills\n- repository-audit-lanes.md: tailrocks-improve and tailrocks-improve-deep\n- version-policy.md: the 13 renamed shared-version-policy.md skill copies\n- design-pipeline.md: the five design skills, which now cite it\n- pr-conventions.md: removed everywhere; the policy is owned by\n  tailrocks-create-pr/references/repo-conventions.md (verified superset)\n\nAlso wire previously implicit citations (design-pipeline in the web, tui and\nmacos design skills plus macos-visual-baseline; version-policy in the tanstack\naudit/remediate/migrate skills with the corrected baseline-reference count),\nadd the waiver-policy paragraph to tailrocks-document, change \"generated\" to\n\"vendored\" in the two surviving repository-audit-lanes copies, and regenerate\ngenerated docs where skill-local files were removed.\n\nSigned-off-by: Alexey Zhokhov <alexey@zhokhov.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"31fa5966864bb3d5ebb3fea193814383f497f4fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tailrocks/tailrocks-open-source-skills/git/trees/31fa5966864bb3d5ebb3fea193814383f497f4fb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tailrocks/tailrocks-open-source-skills/git/commits/6e77a448f9776e837bfc9ab18b833bd5fdc26d3a","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqoBDUCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAJIkQAKb5q+CN2Tl2348NML2wnZH0\nCvwGmxYJzDZ09jWOSSezvicNdvHHLKYI8bj3/V1oWCmAe6Bn9YXGhAomLi6AinCy\nltyoOvoZ2c+sFiUUTRHwT3MKPLBIceiXi2inllqxQJ+K06v5mray3ib2kyUEQVRL\nV7iRvqS7kZPsVSyiIk8uQbvrwSQQHCWIPWavkhyTG5vbfUdqjmzVPCyogULqzXmv\n7tkdl3PplXafseTT00SiVsyJKQOV+7WBeHgS61UsJuFbodYop+/NoUvgBi4TIp5U\nQXEekOp6/S4hxmW4vKBYOn7DuTCZ35uedfGgjoN/BaA5QMJai1vA7qLpqXVahS14\nlte7BXZY16/UzA02j9dmI9iaMHpwKsBmVhtAvdGxY0qcXJOsgJsDMizqA3HjWHfZ\nh9+xLlES2LKgsInyNY/4y/gOlQ9WopTy9bnaTRpZ5dZ5KNPVFDuDmSXn/udbbEtC\n5UsYZ4oRbHi8KD0rh0lYdDghgYAmdeDCEGTptQtzKoWlmA9o9IPZ7KoyxLFZ4QBB\nOiIgpL4wVra/9Y2DKfko4zgjt0uOmnOCwnBLbm16uX7lUkM8QjAJd/xewbDhP9CZ\nFigwl5nROlpt3sHITeXj+om1OO7ngKDhnF1q6jrAax0DQDifMqjfIaAr6kzUSaox\npbGoQPvAeUyuXoeREYBO\n=x6Gu\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 31fa5966864bb3d5ebb3fea193814383f497f4fb\nparent 98134302527b619f774ce7600412365369ebc556\nauthor Alexey Zhokhov <alexey@zhokhov.com> 1788874964 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788874964 +0700\n\nchore: dissolve shared/references into owning skills (#1)\n\nDelete the wholesale-copied shared/references staging set (6 byte-identical\nfiles propagated into every repo at monorepo split, 73% never cited) and keep\nthe byte-identical skill-local copies as the canonical home:\n\n- runtime-trust.md: existing vendored copies in every skill become canonical\n- contribution-handoff.md: the five tailrocks-contribute-* skills\n- repository-audit-lanes.md: tailrocks-improve and tailrocks-improve-deep\n- version-policy.md: the 13 renamed shared-version-policy.md skill copies\n- design-pipeline.md: the five design skills, which now cite it\n- pr-conventions.md: removed everywhere; the policy is owned by\n  tailrocks-create-pr/references/repo-conventions.md (verified superset)\n\nAlso wire previously implicit citations (design-pipeline in the web, tui and\nmacos design skills plus macos-visual-baseline; version-policy in the tanstack\naudit/remediate/migrate skills with the corrected baseline-reference count),\nadd the waiver-policy paragraph to tailrocks-document, change \"generated\" to\n\"vendored\" in the two surviving repository-audit-lanes copies, and regenerate\ngenerated docs where skill-local files were removed.\n\nSigned-off-by: Alexey Zhokhov <alexey@zhokhov.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>","verified_at":"2026-09-08T13:42:44Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tailrocks/tailrocks-open-source-skills/commits/6e77a448f9776e837bfc9ab18b833bd5fdc26d3a","html_url":"https://github.com/tailrocks/tailrocks-open-source-skills/commit/6e77a448f9776e837bfc9ab18b833bd5fdc26d3a","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tailrocks/tailrocks-open-source-skills/commits/6e77a448f9776e837bfc9ab18b833bd5fdc26d3a/comments","author":{"login":"donbeave","id":139017,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzOTAxNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/139017?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave","html_url":"https://github.com/donbeave","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar